Here's a JavaScript function that sorts a JSON object by its keys in alphabetical order:

```javascript
function sortJsonByKeys(jsonObject) {
  const sortedKeys = Object.keys(jsonObject).sort();
  const sortedObject = {};

  sortedKeys.forEach((key) => {
    sortedObject[key] = jsonObject[key];
  });

  return sortedObject;
}
```

