Certainly! Here's an example of an algorithm to solve the problem of finding the maximum element in an array:

```
function findMax(array) {
  let max = array[0];
  for (let i = 1; i < array.length; i++) {
    if (array[i] > max) {
      max = array[i];
    }
  }
  return max;
}
```

This algorithm takes an array as input and returns the maximum element in the array. It works by iterating through the array, comparing each element with the current maximum value, and updating the maximum value if a larger element is found. The time complexity of this algorithm is O(n), where n is the length of the array.

